Package: mibms
Title: MIB-MS Kinome Analysis
Version: 0.0.2.0000
Authors@R: 
    person("Christine", "Berryhill", , "causherm@iu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package analyzes either DDA or DIA MIB-MS data. It cleans it up, extracts kinases, and generates heatmaps, PCA plot, and volcano plots for downstream interpretation. Also now has bioinformatic functions
